{"seq":1,"slug":"cif-invoice-plus-markup","title":"CIF 发票加成投保与保额确定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-cargo-insurance-claims/insured-value-policy/cif-invoice-plus-markup","wordCount":2853,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"cif-发票加成投保与保额确定\">CIF 发票加成投保与保额确定</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境货运保单上的「保险金额」（insured value）不等于货物的成交价，而是成交价乘以一个加成系数后的结果。以 CIF 条件成交的货物，卖方按发票金额加成投保是延续了近百年的行业惯例：<strong>保险金额 = CIF 发票金额 ×（1 + 投保加成率）</strong>，实务中最常见的加成率是 10%，即按发票金额的 110% 投保。</p>\n<p>为什么是 110% 而不是 100%？一笔跨境交易的真实风险敞口大于货物本身的成交价。买方付了货款、付了运费保险费，还可能预付了关税、承担了因货物毁损而产生的融资利息与预期利润损失。国际商会《国际贸易术语解释通则》2020 版（Incoterms 2020）在 CIF、CIP 两条规则的保险条款中明确要求卖方投保「不低于合同价 110%」的金额（<a href=\"https://iccwbo.org/business-solutions/incoterms-rules/incoterms-2020/\">ICC Incoterms 2020</a>），正是把这部分附加成本打进保额。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>常见取值</th>\n<th>决定方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发票金额（invoice value）</td>\n<td>卖方开具的商业发票成交金额</td>\n<td>合同约定</td>\n<td>买卖合同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投保加成率（markup）</td>\n<td>在发票金额之上的加价比例</td>\n<td>10%（惯例）；最高 30%</td>\n<td>买卖合同 / UCP 信用证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险金额（insured amount）</td>\n<td>保单承保的给付上限</td>\n<td>发票金额 × (1+加成率)</td>\n<td>保单 / 保险凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险价值（insurable value）</td>\n<td>保险标的的实际价值</td>\n<td>≈ CIF 货价 + 运杂费</td>\n<td>海商法定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险费（premium）</td>\n<td>投保人支付的代价</td>\n<td>保险金额 × 费率</td>\n<td>保险人报价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>保险金额</code> 与 <code>保险价值</code> 的关系是海商法上的关键：中国《海商法》第 219 条规定保险标的的保险价值由投保人与保险人约定，未约定时按货物发票、运费杂费加保险费计算；第 220 条进一步规定<strong>保险金额超过保险价值的部分无效</strong>——投保人为此多付的保险费可以请求返还。这意味着加成投保有法定上限：当加成率把保额推到超过实际保险价值时，超出部分法律上不受保护。实务中 30% 的上限正是为规避这一条而设的经验线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[商业发票金额 INV] --&gt; B{加成率 m}&#10;  B --&gt;|惯例 10%| C[保额 = INV x 1.10]&#10;  B --&gt;|合同约定 20%/30%| D[保额 = INV x 1.20/1.30]&#10;  B --&gt;|未约定| E[按 110% 默认]&#10;  C --&gt; F[保险价值上限校验]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt;|保额 &lt;= 保险价值| G[保单成立 全额受偿]&#10;  F --&gt;|保额 &gt; 保险价值| H[超出部分无效 退还多收保费]&#10;  G --&gt; I[保费 = 保额 x 费率]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[商业发票金额 INV] --&gt; B{加成率 m}\n  B --&gt;|惯例 10%| C[保额 = INV x 1.10]\n  B --&gt;|合同约定 20%/30%| D[保额 = INV x 1.20/1.30]\n  B --&gt;|未约定| E[按 110% 默认]\n  C --&gt; F[保险价值上限校验]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt;|保额 &lt;= 保险价值| G[保单成立 全额受偿]\n  F --&gt;|保额 &gt; 保险价值| H[超出部分无效 退还多收保费]\n  G --&gt; I[保费 = 保额 x 费率]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"incoterms-2020-的保险条款要求\">Incoterms 2020 的保险条款要求</h2><p>Incoterms 2020 把 CIF 与 CIP 的保险义务做了明确区分，这是 2010 版以来最重要的变化之一。<strong>CIF（仅海运与内河运输）默认要求投保险别为《协会货物条款》C 款（Institute Cargo Clauses C，ICC C）</strong>，双方可约定投更高险别；<strong>CIP（适用于所有运输方式）则强制要求投保 ICC A 款（一切险性质）或类似条款</strong>（<a href=\"https://iccwbo.org/business-solutions/incoterms-rules/incoterms-2020/\">ICC Incoterms 2020</a>）。2010 版 CIP 曾与 CIF 同样只要求 C 款，因集装箱运输下货损风险更分散、投保不足争议频发，2020 版把 CIP 的默认险别一次性上调到 A 款。跨境电商走多式联运与空运时大多适用 CIP，这正是许多平台强制卖家投「一切险」的规则来源。</p>\n<p>保险条款同时规定三件事：<strong>保额不低于合同价的 110%</strong>、<strong>保单币种与合同币种一致</strong>、<strong>保单须使买方（及任何有可保利益者）能直接索赔</strong>。卖方须向买方交付保险单或保险凭证。若买方要求额外加保（如加投战争险、罢工险，或提高加成率），由此增加的费用原则上由买方承担——CIF 卖方的义务是「按惯例投保」，超出惯例的部分是买方需求。</p>\n<p>还需注意 CIF 卖方的基本义务以<strong>单据交付</strong>为终点：卖方交出商业发票、保险单、提单，义务即完成。买方拿到单据后才能自行提货、向保险人索赔。这解释了为什么保单「可转让」「可凭背书转让」在信用证交易中如此重要。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>运输方式</th>\n<th>默认险别</th>\n<th>最低保额</th>\n<th>币种要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CIF</td>\n<td>海运 / 内河</td>\n<td>ICC C</td>\n<td>合同价 110%</td>\n<td>与合同一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CIP</td>\n<td>任意运输方式</td>\n<td>ICC A</td>\n<td>合同价 110%</td>\n<td>与合同一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FOB / FCA</td>\n<td>海运 / 任意</td>\n<td>卖方无投保义务</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DDP</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>买方风险，卖方常自保</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协会货物条款-a-b-c-与保额的关系\">协会货物条款 A/B/C 与保额的关系</h2><p>保额只是赔偿上限，能否获赔取决于<strong>险别</strong>。三套协会货物条款（Institute Cargo Clauses，现行版本为 2009 年 1 月 1 日修订版）承保范围差异巨大：<strong>A 款承保一切外来风险（all risks），仅受除外责任限制</strong>；<strong>B 款与 C 款采用列举式承保，只赔条款列明的风险</strong>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Incoterms\">Wikipedia: Incoterms</a>）。C 款最窄，通常只覆盖重大事故如船舶搁浅、触礁、沉没、火灾、碰撞，不赔常见的装卸破损、淡水雨淋、偷窃。</p>\n<p>中国的海洋运输货物保险条款（CIC，中国人民保险公司 1981 年条款）把基本险分为<strong>平安险（FPA）、水渍险（WPA/WA）、一切险（All Risks）</strong>，与 ICC 三款大致对应为 C、B、A，但<strong>并非逐条等同</strong>——两套条款的除外责任、免赔额设计不同，不能简单互换（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marine_insurance\">Wikipedia: Marine insurance</a>）。跨境电商卖家常在保单上同时看到「按 PICC 海洋货物运输保险条款承保」与「投保一切险」的表述。</p>\n<p>保额与险别的交互体现在<strong>不足额与超额</strong>两种错配上。若加成率过低（如按 100% 投保），一旦发生全损，货款虽赔足，但买方已付运费、关税与预期利润无法覆盖；若加成率过高（如超过 30%），超出保险价值的部分无效。而若险别选得过窄（CIF 默认 C 款），即使保额充足，常见的部分损失仍可能因不属于列举风险而遭拒赔——<strong>这是跨境电商索赔失败率最高的单一原因</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cif-cfr-fob-价格换算与保费计算\">CIF/CFR/FOB 价格换算与保费计算</h2><p>保额与保费的计算依赖价格条件。若合同以 CFR 或 FOB 成交但需投保，必须先把价格换算为 CIF 价。设发票金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CIF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，加成率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，费率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>保险费</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{保险费} = CIF \\times (1 + m) \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">保险费</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>反过来，由 CFR 价推 CIF 价时，因保费本身也进入投保基数，需用除式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CIF = \\frac{CFR}{1 - (1 + m) \\times r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举例：一批货 CFR 价 100,000 美元，加成率 10%，一切险费率 0.15%，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100,000</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1.10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.0015</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100,000</mn><mn>0.99835</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>100,165.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CIF = \\frac{100{,}000}{1 - 1.10 \\times 0.0015} = \\frac{100{,}000}{0.99835} \\approx 100{,}165.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0015</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.99835</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">165.3</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>保险费约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100,165.3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.0015</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>165.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100{,}165.3 \\times 1.10 \\times 0.0015 \\approx 165.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">165.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0015</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">165.3</span></span></span></span></span> 美元。可见在低费率品类（费率常在万分之几到千分之几之间）上保费占货值比例很小，但<strong>加成率对保额的影响是线性的</strong>：把加成率从 10% 提到 30%，保额与保费同步上升约 18%。对卖方而言这是可谈判的空间；对买方而言，这是覆盖预期利润与关税的实际保障。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价格条件</th>\n<th>卖方承担</th>\n<th>谁投保</th>\n<th>保费进入何价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FOB</td>\n<td>装运港船上交货</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>不含保费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CFR</td>\n<td>成本加运费</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>不含保费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CIF</td>\n<td>成本+保险+运费</td>\n<td>卖方</td>\n<td>含保费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CIP</td>\n<td>成本+保险+运费（任意方式）</td>\n<td>卖方</td>\n<td>含保费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"信用证与保单金额的合规校验\">信用证与保单金额的合规校验</h2><p>在信用证（L/C）结算下，保单金额是<strong>单据审核的硬指标</strong>，写错一个数字就可能构成不符点（discrepancy）而被拒付。跟单信用证统一惯例 UCP 600 第 28 条「保险单据与承保范围」规定：<strong>若信用证未规定投保金额，银行将接受的最低投保金额为 CIF 或 CIP 价值的 110%</strong>；保单币种须与信用证币种一致；当信用证要求「一切险」时，只要保单含有任何「一切险」批注即被接受，而不要求险别精确对应某套条款名称（<a href=\"https://iccwbo.org/publication/ucp-600/\">UCP 600 Art.28</a>）。</p>\n<p>这三条对跨境卖家有直接的操作含义。其一，<strong>保额不得低于发票与运费的 110%</strong>，且必须从单据表面即可算出，银行不负责替买卖双方做换算；其二，<strong>保单币种必须与信用证一致</strong>，美元信用证配人民币保单是典型不符点；其三，<strong>「一切险」的写法比险别实质更重要</strong>——投保 ICC A 但保单上没有 all risks 字样，仍可能被拒。</p>\n<p>保险单与保险凭证（certificate）的区别也在这里显现：<strong>保险单（policy）是正式合同文本，保险凭证是简式证明</strong>。UCP 600 第 28 条允许银行接受保险凭证，但要求其内容不得与保险单矛盾。跨境电商平台或货代签发的「预约保险单声明」（open cover declaration）在 UCP 下通常可作保险凭证使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区与实务校验清单\">常见误区与实务校验清单</h2><p>加成投保最容易被忽略的是**「加成 ≠ 保额可以随意抬高」**。加成是伪装的成本覆盖工具，不是规避风险的放大器。以下对照表列出实务中最常见的错配。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>正确理解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>「按发票金额 100% 投保就够了」</td>\n<td>未覆盖运费、关税、预期利润；CIF/CIP 下 ICC 要求最低 110%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>「加成越高越好」</td>\n<td>超过保险价值的部分依海商法无效，多付保费不获赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>「投保一切险就等于什么都赔」</td>\n<td>一切险仍有除外责任（自然损耗、包装不当、固有瑕疵、延迟）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>「CIF 默认投一切险」</td>\n<td>CIF 默认 ICC C（最窄）；CIP 才默认 ICC A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>「保单币种可以随便写」</td>\n<td>信用证下必须与信用证币种一致，否则构成不符点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>「保额随便取整」</td>\n<td>须从单据表面可核验 ≥110%，取整过低即不符点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>落地时可按下表逐项核对一票货的投保配置，避免在理赔阶段才发现保额或险别不足。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验项</th>\n<th>检查内容</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加成率</td>\n<td>是否 ≥10%，是否 ≤30%</td>\n<td>Incoterms 2020 / 海商法 220 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>险别</td>\n<td>CIF 是否需升级到 A 款；CIP 是否已含 A 款</td>\n<td>Incoterms 2020</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种</td>\n<td>是否与合同/信用证一致</td>\n<td>UCP 600 Art.28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保额基数</td>\n<td>是否含运费与保险费</td>\n<td>CIF 定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单据类型</td>\n<td>保险单或保险凭证是否可转让</td>\n<td>UCP 600 Art.28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>免赔额</td>\n<td>是否有 franchise / excess 条款</td>\n<td>保单批注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>保额公式</strong>：保险金额 = CIF 发票金额 ×（1 + 投保加成率），惯例加成率 10%，上限约 30%。</li>\n<li><strong>法定上限</strong>：中国《海商法》第 220 条规定保额超过保险价值部分无效，多收保费应退还。</li>\n<li><strong>规则要求</strong>：Incoterms 2020 要求 CIF/CIP 最低投保合同价的 110%，且保额币种与合同一致。</li>\n<li><strong>险别差异</strong>：CIF 默认 ICC C（最窄），CIP 强制 ICC A（最宽）；中国条款的平安险/水渍险/一切险大致对应 C/B/A 但不等同。</li>\n<li><strong>信用证校验</strong>：UCP 600 第 28 条规定未约定时银行接受 110% 投保，币种与信用证一致，「一切险」以批注字样为准。</li>\n<li><strong>保费换算</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CIF = CFR / [1 - (1+m) \\times r]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，保费 = 保额 × 费率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 的兄弟章节中，投保环节之后是核损与定损流程，参见 <a href=\"../risk-loss-assessment/\">风险与损失评估</a>，以及理赔系统如何接收并校验这些保额字段，参见 <a href=\"../claims-settlement-system/\">理赔结算系统</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CIF 发票加成投保与保额确定","id":"cif-发票加成投保与保额确定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Incoterms 2020 的保险条款要求","id":"incoterms-2020-的保险条款要求"},{"level":2,"text":"协会货物条款 A/B/C 与保额的关系","id":"协会货物条款-a-b-c-与保额的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"CIF/CFR/FOB 价格换算与保费计算","id":"cif-cfr-fob-价格换算与保费计算"},{"level":2,"text":"信用证与保单金额的合规校验","id":"信用证与保单金额的合规校验"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区与实务校验清单","id":"常见误区与实务校验清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"战争险、罢工险与附加险配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-cargo-insurance-claims/insurance-basics-cover/war-strikes-additional-cover"},"next":{"title":"预约保单与保险凭证配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-cargo-insurance-claims/insured-value-policy/open-cover-certificate-config"}}